# Publish to test (GitHub only)

After a visible app change that passes `node tools/test_all.js` and a version bump, always commit (if needed) and push to branch `test` (`origin/test`). Do not wait for a separate push ask.

- Working branch may be `store-publish` tracking `origin/test`; push updates that remote.
- Push to GitHub is **backup / channel sync**, not install on the car.
- On the head unit use **HotPatch only** — never tell the owner to Store Update / reinstall as the normal deploy path.
- Never force-push; never commit `oap-sdk/`, `*.mgu`, keys, VIN, or HU logs.
